WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(energetic upbeat music)
- [Katie] I'm ready,

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.280
let's do this.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.450
- Oh, it's wrong.

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.440
- What did you do? (laughs)

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.840
- Boo.
(cast booing)

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.817
- Hey, welcome back to a new season of

00:00:09.817 --> 00:00:12.306
"Lost in Translation".
- [Katie] Woo.

00:00:12.306 --> 00:00:13.680
- [Jasmine] Woo.
(cast clapping)

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.790
- I can't even read the English.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:18.120
- March nine large seeds
into the Super Bowl.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.650
- This is just too much to process.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.090
- [Katie] As usual, we take a recipe,

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.530
we put it into Google Translate,

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.530
and there are gonna be a ton
of surprises this season.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:26.970
Let's bring out the hint box.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.100
The snow is divided and there is a woman

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.660
of seven large beds.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.550
- I'm having a lot of fun, actually.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.680
So make sure to tune in every single week,

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.210
so you don't miss out.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.380
- Wow.
- What?

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.580
- Hey, this is not going well.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.110
- Wait, do I get any hints?

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:42.417
- Cute shirts everyone.
- [Everyone] Thank you.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:43.263
- You were,

00:00:43.263 --> 00:00:45.870
♪ Already on the right track ♪

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:46.830
- [Jasmine] Are you kidding?

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:47.913
- Season two baby.

